SUMMARY:[Signal Processing][Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition] EUVIP 20
 27 - Regular paper submission deadline (estimated)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: European Conference on Visual Information Pro
 cessing\nWebsite: https://euvip2026.github.io/\nSource URL: https://euvip
 2026.github.io/\nLocation: To be announced\nTopics: Signal Processing\, C
 omputer Vision & Pattern Recognition\, Machine Learning\, Deep Representa
 tion Learning\nSize: S\nSubmission type: Paper-based / visual information
  processing\nConfidence: estimated\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes:
  No organizer-confirmed 2027 edition\; 2026-10-28 review found no success
 or on the EUVIP 2026 site or programme. Meeting and paper timing are annu
 al proxies from 2026's final extended deadline\; the first 2027 deadline 
 may be earlier. Website and timezone belong to the 2026 edition\; locatio
 n is unannounced.\nScope: Visual information processing across image\, vi
 deo\, 3D\, and unconventional sensing modalities. Its defining areas are 
 computational imaging\, restoration and enhancement\, coding\, recognitio
 n\, multimodal fusion\, and subjective/objective quality assessment. Rend
 ering and visualizing data\, human/biometric analysis\, and robust evalua
 tion are recurring strands. An extensive applications list is not treated
  as equal coverage of every application domain or every responsible-AI su
 btopic.\nAdditional topics: Multimedia Learning & Retrieval\, Computer Gr
 aphics & Visualization\, Biometrics & Human Sensing\, Robustness & Safety
 \nScope sources (2026): https://euvip2026.github.io/C4P.pdf\, https://euv
 ip2026.github.io/calls/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://euvip2026.github.io/
END:VEVENT
